# Construction Domain

- Jobsite roles (PM / supervisor / trade) ≠ consumer “users”; respect `documentation/role-permission-matrix.md`
- Wrong-project data is a safety defect — preserve project isolation walls
- Core loop: capture evidence (photo) → task → review → reject/rework → complete
- Field constraints: fat-finger UI, camera-first create, poor network, location_on_site when in scope
- Do not invent SaaS dashboard patterns that fight mobile jobsite use
- Upcoming gated slices (after M-SUPABASE-03b): tags/assignee, delegation, location, containers
